{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nekogumi is a single player, third person cafe-adventure game. It is a cosy game where you\u2019d find companions among silly and funny animals and work together to protect and bring prosper to the neighbourhood.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Run the hood and your caf\u00e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022 Earn coins to buy new furniture for the caf\u00e9, or spend it all on your wardrobe, it's your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597890/extras/3.gif?t=1743574957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022 Play dressup with Bruce, when will you ever get a cat to cooperate with weird costumes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597890/extras/4.gif?t=1743574957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\u2022 Live out the imaginary fantasy of being the hood boss or a feline superhero. This cat loooooves to cosplay~<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597890/extras/2.gif?t=1743574957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022 Complete quests, fight some rats and clean up the neighbourhood<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597890/extras/1.gif?t=1743574957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Recruit an array of cats and animals, they could be a little\u2026odd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 You get to jump around, enjoy some bouncy cat action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597890/extras/6.gif?t=1743574957\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597890?t=1743574957","background_raw":"https